msgstr "¡Entá nun se ganó'l xuegu!"

#: view.cpp:27
msgid ""
"<h3>Rules of Game</h3><p>You are the system administrator and your goal is "
"to connect each terminal and each cable to the central server.</p><p>Click "
"the right mouse button to turn the cable in a clockwise direction, and the "
"left mouse button to turn the cable in a counterclockwise direction.</"
"p><p>Start the LAN with as few turns as possible!</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Regles del xuegu</h3><p>Yes l'alministrador del sistema y el to oxetivu "
"será coneutar cada máquina y cada cable al sirvidor central.</p><p>Usa'l "
"botón drechu del mur pa xirar el cable nel sentíu de les aguyes del reló, y "
"l'izquierdu pa xiralu nel sentíu contrariu a les aguyes del reló.</p><p>"
"¡Arranca la rede col mínimu númberu de vueltes posible!</p>"

